# Template boundaries

Designers and agents **must not edit** DS-owned paths. Request new shared APIs from the template maintainer, then merge `upstream`.

## DS-owned (read-only in product repos)

- `css/**`
- `components.js`, `components-date.js`, `styles.css`
- `gallery/**`
- `CHANGELOG.md` (maintainer release notes)

## Product-owned

- `features/**`
- `docs/PRODUCT-VOICE.md`
- `app.js` (nav routes and `FEATURE_MOUNTERS` only)
- `i18n.js` (product strings)
- `PROGRESS.md`

## When something is missing

- **Reusable:** ask maintainer to add upstream, then `git fetch upstream && git merge upstream/main`.
- **One-off:** Figma MCP + implement in `features/` using tokens and `DS.*`; do not fork `components.js`.
- **Extend:** wrappers in `features/shared/`.

Do not add non-Cursor agent desktop config folders to this repo.
